### Topic 53 - Actuator, Monitoring and Observability
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1) Discovery page: which actuator endpoints are exposed?
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator

### 2) Health (overall + components, incl. our custom "paymentGateway")
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 3) Kubernetes-style probes
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

### 4) Info: app, build, java, os + our "shop" section
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info

### 5) Place a few orders (creates custom metrics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product": "Coffee Mug", "amount": 12.50, "paymentMethod": "UPI" }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product": "Laptop Stand", "amount": 49.90, "paymentMethod": "card" }

### 6) List all metric names
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics

### 7) Our custom counter, total and filtered by tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/shop.orders.placed

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/shop.orders.placed?tag=paymentMethod:upi

### 8) Timer, gauge, summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/shop.orders.processing

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/shop.orders.pending

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/shop.orders.amount

### 9) Built-in metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/jvm.memory.used

### 10) Everything in Prometheus text format
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### 11) Payment gateway DOWN -> health DOWN (HTTP 503), new orders become PENDING
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payment-gateway?up=false

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payment-gateway?up=true

### 12) Loggers: read the level of our package
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/loggers/com.course.observability

### 13) Change it to DEBUG at runtime (no restart!) - now OrderService logs "Placing order ..."
POST {{baseUrl}}/actuator/loggers/com.course.observability
Content-Type: application/json

{ "configuredLevel": "DEBUG" }

### 14) Reset to the configured level
POST {{baseUrl}}/actuator/loggers/com.course.observability
Content-Type: application/json

{ "configuredLevel": null }

### 15) dev profile only (-Dspring-boot.run.profiles=dev): env, beans, mappings
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/env

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/mappings
